### 1. Root Welcome Endpoint
GET http://localhost:5000/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get All Courses
GET http://localhost:5000/api/courses
Accept: application/json

### 3. Filter Courses by Level
GET http://localhost:5000/api/courses?level=Advanced
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Course by Seed ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/courses/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create a New Course
POST http://localhost:5000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Architecture & CQRS in .NET",
  "description": "Learn enterprise software patterns and MediatR",
  "level": "Intermediate",
  "price": 39.99
}

### 6. Validation Error Demo (Negative Price)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "price": -10.00
}
